Real Production Scenario
Question
VM CPU metrics visible but syslog missing. Why?

Correct Analysis
Likely:
Diagnostic settings enabled
BUT
AMA/DCR not configured

Another Scenario
Question
KeyVault audit logs missing.
Correct Analysis
Need:
Diagnostic settings enabled on KeyVault
AMA irrelevant here.

| Capability          | AMA | Diagnostic Settings |
| ------------------- | --- | ------------------- |
| VM OS logs          | YES | NO                  |
| Windows events      | YES | NO                  |
| Syslog              | YES | NO                  |
| App logs            | YES | LIMITED             |
| Azure platform logs | NO  | YES                 |
| KeyVault audit      | NO  | YES                 |
| NSG flow logs       | NO  | YES                 |
| Activity logs       | NO  | YES                 |
| Needs agent         | YES | NO                  |








